@cc [owner:saharshbaweja,label:product] aeros-dark-paired-colors
Marketing dark-theme surfaces and foregrounds must be changed as pairs. Visible body text,
links, form labels, and control labels must retain at least 4.5:1 contrast against solid
backgrounds; large headings must retain at least 3:1. Disabled controls are exempt.
Theme changes must preserve the fixed desktop preview canvas and portrait feature aspect ratios.
